@ContentService_HostAddress = http://localhost:7461

### ============================================
### SCENARIO 1: All Immediate (Fast Path)
### Providers: outline-fast + audio-quick + video-fast
### Total Time: ~13s
### ============================================
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/customer-contents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/scenario1-all-immediate",
  "outlineProviderKey": "outline-fast",
  "audioProviderKey": "audio-quick",
  "videoProviderKey": "video-fast"
}

### ============================================
### SCENARIO 2: Immediate + Immediate + Sync (Files)
